        "title": "Creator Contracts, Licensing and Invoicing",
        "content": "Look brother, 90% of financial fraud and payment disputes in the creator economy happen for one reason: **\"WhatsApp DM Agreements and Oral Commitments\"**.\n\nPR managers text: *\"Bro, start the shoot, send the invoice, payment will be cleared next week!\"* Fast forward 90 days later: PR manager is not answering WhatsApp messages, and the brand is claiming they never authorized the campaign fee!\n\nContracts, licensing agreements, and formal invoices are NOT useless bureaucracy — they are your **LEGAL BULLETPROOF ARMOR**.\n\n---\n\n### 10 Non-Negotiable Contract Clauses Every Creator Must Check\n\nWhenever any brand, PR agency, or corporate client sends you a legal contract (Influencer Service Agreement), before signing, read these 10 clauses with a **magnifying glass**:\n\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 10 ESSENTIAL CREATOR CONTRACT CLAUSES                                  │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 1. Scope of Work (SOW) and Revision Cap                               │\n│ 2. Usage Rights, Licensing Tenure and Territory                        │\n│ 3. Whitelisting / Boosted Ads Access Rights                            │\n│ 4. Exclusivity and Category Non-Compete Scope                          │\n│ 5. Payment Terms and Late Payment Interest Clause                      │\n│ 6. IP Ownership and Raw Asset Rights                                   │\n│ 7. Termination and Kill Fee Clause                                     │\n│ 8. Indemnity and Liability Limit Cap                                   │\n│ 9. Governing Law and Dispute Jurisdiction                              │\n│ 10. Force Majeure and Campaign Cancellation                            │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n#### Clause 1: Scope of Work (SOW) and Revision Cap\n- **The Risk:** Brands demand 10 rounds of script rewrites, re-shoots, and endless editing changes after video delivery.\n- **Protective Text:**\n > *\"Deliverables are strictly limited to: (a) 1x YouTube Video Integration (60-90 seconds), (b) 1x Instagram Reel. The agreed compensation covers up to 2 rounds of reasonable revisions. Additional revisions beyond 2 rounds shall be billed at Rs.5,000 per revision round.\"*",
