        "title": "Creator Contracts, Licensing and Invoicing (Part 2)",
        "content": "| Tax and Accounting Parameter | Category A: Advertising and Promotional Service | Category B: IP / Copyright Licensing Fee |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Invoice Line Item Description** | \"Social Media Promotion and Content Creation Services for Campaign X\" | \"Licensing Rights Fee for Commercial Video Asset Usage (90 Days)\" |\n| **GST SAC Code (Services Accounting Code)** | **998361** (Advertising Services) | **997332** (Licensing Services of Intellectual Property) |\n| **Income Tax TDS Section** | Section 194C (1% for Individual/HUF) or Section 194J (10%) | Section 194J (10% Royalty / IP Rights Fee) |\n| **Applicable GST Rate** | 18% | 18% |\n| **Practical Guidance** | Use for standard integrations, Reels, and sponsored posts | Use when selling raw video footage rights to brands for TV/Ads |\n\n---\n\n### Professional Creator Tax Invoice Template\n\nSending a haphazard text message with your UPI ID makes you look like an amateur. Brands' accounts departments prioritize formal PDF tax invoices. Below is a compliant invoice layout:\n\n```markdown\n================================================================================\n                          INVOICE / TAX INVOICE\n================================================================================\nINVOICE NO: RM/2025-26/089     INVOICE DATE: 15 November 2025\nDUE DATE: 15 December 2025 (Net 30)     SAC CODE: 998361\n\nISSUED BY (CREATOR):               BILLED TO (CLIENT / BRAND):\nRohan Digital Studios              Nexus Marketing Pvt Ltd\nPAN: ABCPR9876K                    GSTIN: 27AAAAA1234A1Z5\nGSTIN: 07BCDE5678F1ZH (If GST Regd) Attn: Accounts Payable Team\nAddress: Flat 402, Green Park, New Delhi  Address: Bandra-Kurla Complex, Mumbai\nEmail: business@rohandigital.in    Email: finance@nexusmarketing.in\nPhone: +91 98765 43210\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nS.No.  Description of Deliverables              Qty   Rate (Rs.)  Total (Rs.)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1.     YouTube Video Integration (90 sec)       1     45,000      45,000\n2.     Instagram Reel (60 sec)                   1     25,000      25,000\n3.     Instagram Story (3 frames)                1     10,000      10,000\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                                          Sub-Total:    80,000\n                                          GST @ 18%:    14,400\n                                          TOTAL:        94,400\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAmount in Words: Rupees Ninety-Four Thousand Four Hundred Only\n\nBank Details:                                   UPI ID:\nA/C Name: Rohan Digital Studios                rohan@upi\nA/C No: 1234567890                             PAN: ABCPR9876K\nBank: HDFC Bank, New Delhi\nIFSC: HDFC0001234\n```",
