        "title": "Creator Contracts, Licensing and Invoicing (Part 3)",
        "content": "### Payment Recovery Escalation Email Sequence\n\nWhen a brand defaults on payment, follow this 3-step escalation:\n\n##### Email 1: Polite Reminder (Day T+7 after due date)\n```text\nSubject: Gentle Reminder — Invoice #RM/2025-26/089 (7 Days Overdue)\n\nDear Accounts Team / [Brand Manager Name],\n\nThis is a gentle reminder that invoice #RM/2025-26/089 for Rs.90,000, which was due on 15 December 2025, remains unpaid.\n\nKindly remit the outstanding payment at your earliest convenience and share the transaction UTR number.\n\nBest regards,\nRohan\nRohan Digital Studios\n```\n\n##### Email 2: Firm Escalation and Work Pause Notice (Day T+7)\n```text\nSubject: OVERDUE INVOICE NOTICE: Invoice #RM/2025-26/089 (7 Days Overdue)\n\nDear Accounts Team / [Brand Manager Name],\n\nThis email is to draw your urgent attention to invoice #RM/2025-26/089 for Rs.90,000, which was due on 15 December 2025 and remains unpaid as of today.\n\nAs per our contract terms, please note that we have temporarily paused all ongoing deliverables and whitelisting ad access for active campaigns.\n\nKindly remit the outstanding payment immediately and share the transaction UTR number.\n\nRegards,\nRohan\nRohan Digital Studios\n```\n\n##### Email 3: Pre-Legal Notice under MSMED Act 2006 (Day T+30)\n```text\nSubject: FINAL NOTICE PRIOR TO LEGAL PROCEEDINGS: Invoice #RM/2025-26/089 (Under MSME Protection)\n\nTo: Board of Directors / Accounts Head, Nexus Marketing Pvt Ltd\n\nRef: Overdue invoice #RM/2025-26/089 amounting to Rs.90,000 (30 Days Overdue)\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nDespite repeated reminders dated 10th Dec and 22nd Dec, the payment of Rs.90,000 due against services rendered remains unpaid.\n\nPlease be advised that Rohan Digital Studios is a registered Micro Enterprise under the Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises Development (MSMED) Act, 2006 (UDYAM Registration: UDYAM-DL-00-1234567).\n\nUnder Section 15 and 16 of the MSMED Act:\n1. Buyers are statutorily mandated to clear payments within 45 days.\n2. Failure to pay within 45 days attracts mandatory compound interest at THREE TIMES (3x) the RBI bank rate from the due date.\n\nWe request you to clear the principal amount along with applicable late payment interest within 7 business days, failing which we shall proceed to lodge a legal recovery petition on the MSME Samadhaan portal (samadhaan.msme.gov.in) without further notice.\n\nSincerely,\nRohan\nSole Proprietor, Rohan Digital Studios\nUDYAM Reg: UDYAM-DL-00-1234567\n```",
